{
  "bookId": "hero-212204",
  "id": "bond-27526",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27526001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "干得不错，我的「所有物」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "用尽全力为我挥霍你的财产，这是你应该做的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27526004",
              "text": "真是无情。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27526004",
              "text": "对于我的礼物……只这样说吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27526003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "当然，我也愿意为你挥霍我的一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27526006",
              "text": "任性的回答。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27526006",
              "text": "果然是我行我素阿……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27526005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "让你难过了吗，真没办法……\n总之……谢谢你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……我是认真的，谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "一直以来我都习惯了「抢夺」，这还是初次被人「给予」，\n感觉……意外很不错~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27526010",
              "text": "是这样吗……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27526010",
              "text": "忽然有点好奇「S-VIII」的过去呢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27526009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我知道你对我的过去很感兴趣，有机会我可以带你去我的家乡看看，尽管……那里已经是一片废墟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "好了，肉麻时间结束。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27526012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "接下来，一起找点乐子怎么样？\n——很刺激那种。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
